it's just too tough on the trap owners - should have known better.

There is also something called "reasonable support" clause in most
legal codes. That means that even if you own the land you are not
allowed to dig a hole 1mm away from your neighbour's land 'cause
it would make his house to collapse into the hole that you've dug.
That, however, might be a bit tricky to enforce if you go ahead
and remove the pyramids :-)




