	m.kraemer@gsi.de (Michael Kraemer) writes:
> In article <x7idnaKOBpB8k13fRVn-ow@rcn.net>, jmfbahciv@aol.com writes:
>> In article <d9p2co$ett$1@lnx107.hrz.tu-darmstadt.de>,
