> software development, 

Actually, originally he did say precisely that.  And being someone
who at that point in time was feeding my family based on the money
I earned developing software, well, you should be able to see why
I don't hold him as fondly as some here seem to.

I'll have to look around my attic and see if I still have the March 1985
issue of Dr. Dobb's.  I think very few people, including his advocates,
actually know what he said originally.

