Interesting.

>  
>> > Still I don't see any business or legal logic that would hinder HP
>> > (or any company) to give away stuff for free even if they
>> > have licensed parts of it from others. 
>> 
>> The license they have negotiated with the original owner of the IP.
> 
> Sorry, do you try tell me that such "licenses" say:
> 
> "Dear HP, you can use our stuff, but for the binaries you created with it
