Once I'd played Dungeon (which was the first of these games for me to
encounter) I found the original ADVENT (or "Colossal Cave Adventure") to
be extremely crude and challenge-free[1].  Most particularly, the natural
language parser was miles inferior (which, to be fair to the authors, is
permissible, since it was much older).

