The front panel contains an active component (one integrated circuit). The
ic is between
the switches and the address jumper. Without power all connections on the
connector
the same resistance regardless of the switch settings or jumper value.
But without the front panel the disk spins up and comes on-line. That way it
is useful
inside a VAX 4100.

