>
> If you trace the wires from the front panel, follow the run switch in
> the ribbon cable to a jumper block on the disk. You can either
> install a different switch on those two pins, or else jumper it as
necessary.
> By refault, the run/stop switch is in 'run', so you only need the switch
if
