The way I remember BA350 is that BA350 does have 50HD connectors at the 
backplane level. BA356 variants had on the other hand something called 
I/O module at same place and this I/O module brought the scsi connectors
much closer for easiar access. With FAST WIDE style BA356 one has at 
least two different I/O modules, one with 50HD connectors and another
with 68HD connectors.

The Ultrascsi style BA356 aka DS-BA356-xx (blue box) have typically
68VHDCI connectors on the I/O module

