Adventure was ported to the PDP-8 by Rick (Dick) Murphy. IIRC he used the
FORTRAN compiler to generate RALF, then hand optimized the code to get it to
fit on a full blown 64K PDP-8/E. I know I had a copy of this long ago.

Dungeon was bigger than Adventure. I don't recall it ever being ported to
the -8, but both were on my RT-11 systems.

