The 210W power supply shuts OFF if it senses that either fan has failed. 
The 180W power supply does not sense fan failures.

Power Supply Connector Pin Number  Wire Colour Voltage
"P10, P11(Disk Drive) " 1  Red  +5V
 2  Black  GND
 3  Black  GND
 4 Blue +12V
"P14,P12 and P13(Disk Drives)" 1  Blue  +12V
 2  Black  GND
 3  Black  GND
 4 Red +5V
P8(motherboard) 1  White  POK_H
 2  Red  +5V
 3  Orange  +12V
 4  Yellow  -12V (key)
 5  Black  GND
 6 Black GND
P9(motherboard) 1  Black  GND (key)
 2  Black  GND
 3  Gray  -5V
 4  Red  +5V
 5  Red  +5V
 6 Red  +5V
P3(motherboard)  1  Black  GND
 2  Black  GND
 3 Black  GND
 4  Orange  +3.3V
 5  Orange  +3.3V(key)
 6 Orange +3.3V
P4(motherboard) Not present on 180W supply. 1  Green  +3.3V
 2  Green  +3.3V
 3  Green  +3.3V
 4  Black  GND
 5  Black  GND
 6  Black GND(key)
Fan connector variable (8.5-15.2V) Not present on 180W supply. 1  Red  +Fan
 2 Black Fan Rtn.

Alex




