If it's Emulex it would be more likely to be a tape drive or perhaps a 
SCSI controller.  Any firmware chips?  They would have date/version
info on them.

Pix would help, yes.  High res if possible, show both sides, the 
connectors and any markings, such as bios/firmware dates/versions.


Geoff in Oz


